## MCP Prompts Specification

### 1. `activate_synthesizer`
```
Read .brain/ state and execute current sprint as Synthesizer.
Available tools: brain_emit_event, brain_read_events, brain_trigger_agent, etc.
```

### 2. [start_sprint](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/agent_manager.py#602-644)
```
Initialize a new sprint with goal: {goal}
Use brain_update_state and brain_emit_event to set up.
```

